WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.905
This starter code turns left before collecting. Test it and watch what happens.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:10.920
The pirate turned on the spot. Click the first step to edit it.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.384
Choose Move instead. Keep Collect as the last step.

00:00:15.384 --> 00:00:20.822
Test again. This time the pirate moves onto the chest before collecting.
